Title: "Label"
Id: "30ca6f88-0b0e-43dc-8dcc-13fa4e3b6b5d"

Text: "A `label:` justification item contains optional label text, optional `by:` text, and a required `comment:`.

```mlg-fragment
Justified:
. label: \"Pairing\"
  by: \"ZFC\"
  comment: \"The axiom supplies the required set.\"
```

The optional heading, when present, is a label header."
Id: "058b78be-f0c8-4751-ba78-7c44c62cfb33"
